WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.073
University is one of a family’s biggest costs,

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:05.337
and it comes on a known date.

3
00:00:06.437 --> 00:00:09.861
Take the yearly cost, multiply by the years of study,

4
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.089
add inflation, take away what you already have,

5
00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:15.921
and spread the rest over the months that remain.

6
00:00:17.021 --> 00:00:18.878
A good plan does two things:

7
00:00:19.006 --> 00:00:21.828
it builds the capital, and it makes sure the goal is not

8
00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:25.298
lost if the paying parent dies or can no longer work.

9
00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:29.150
The main ways are a savings plan with life cover,

10
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.993
an investment-linked plan and bank savings.

11
00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:34.303
Many families combine two.

12
00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:39.315
And the earlier you start, the smaller the monthly amount.

13
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:42.319
Work out an estimate of the study goal

14
00:00:42.319 --> 00:00:44.745
with the free tool on avrastro.com.
